window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I can save the world. I just may have to ruin all of my friends’ lives in the process.</p> <p>Of all the people tasked with making sure the realms don’t burn and the worlds don’t end, I’m surely the most unlikely choice.<br> <br> Unfortunately for me, fate doesn’t care.</p> <p>Don’t get me wrong–I’m more than capable. But I prefer a direct approach. Unfortunately, I need the Unseelie King’s precious sword, and he would see my teeth and claws a mile away.</p> <p>So this will require precision. Somehow, I need to convince the bane of my existence to trust me enough to let down his guard.</p> <p>And then I have to betray him.</p>"; 
